{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50718","headline":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其一 · 张祜","name":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南下丹阳一水湾，陋居瓢饮是希颜。\n来爲野鸟入春郭，去作溪云归夜山。\n蓬鬓已衰言必贱，竹门虽立意无关。\n陶潜惠远如相爱，朝访遗民暮却还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}